Full JWT + bcrypt Authentication Flow: Register, Login, Logout, Protected Routes, and persistent user session state, plus a 1-click "Try Demo Researcher Account" login.

Research Workspace Management: Create, view, filter, search, and delete domain-specific Research Workspaces with custom research questions and hypothesis tracking.

Multi-Format Source Ingestion (Multer + Text Parser):

Upload .pdf, .txt, or .md files (parsed server-side via pdf-parse / UTF-8 buffer extraction) or submit raw text/DOI abstracts.

Automatic AI extraction upon upload: generates executive summary, atomic claims list, methodology evaluation, credibility/rigor score (0–100), and topic keywords.

AI Cross-Source Synthesis & Contradiction Matrix:

Select 2+ sources in a workspace and trigger a deep synthesis run.

Generates: Executive Literature Review, Consensus Themes Matrix, Contradiction & Discrepancy Alerts, Identified Research Gaps, and Evidence-Based Decision Recommendations.

Citation-Grounded Research Copilot (Chat):

Contextual Q&A thread per workspace that passes indexed document summaries and extracted claims to Gemini and returns answers with strict `` citations and suggested follow-up questions.

Knowledge Claim & Evidence Explorer:

Interactive filterable view of all extracted atomic claims across all documents in a workspace, tagged by claim type (empirical_finding, statistic, methodology, limitation, hypothesis) and confidence rating.

Exportable Synthesis Reports:

One-click export of any AI Literature Review or Synthesis Report to clean Markdown (.md) or print-ready PDF view.

